Package: juist
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: juist developers <noreply@github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: systemd
Recommends: polkitd
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/nning/juist
Description: peer-to-peer mesh VPN with no coordination server
 juist is a peer-to-peer mesh VPN with no coordination server. WireGuard
 carries the traffic; who belongs to the network is a log signed by its
 admins, which every device checks for itself. This package installs the
 CLI, the node daemon and its systemd unit.
